# Vue Adapter

- DND-FX.2 is COMPLETE. Keep `@dndgem/vue` thin; do not add a Nuxt package, Angular, or a parallel runtime.
- Vue is a peerDependency of `@dndgem/vue` (`^3.5.0`). Vue 2 is not supported.
- Do not bundle Vue into the library.
- `@dndgem/vue` may depend on `@dndgem/core` and `@dndgem/dom`.
- Do not place solver, Auto-Layout, provenance, or drag policy in the Vue package.
- Do not import `@dnd-kit/*` or `@dndgem/react` from Vue. Consume `createLayoutSession` / public DOM types only.
- Cleanup must call the DOM session `dispose()` path. Do not invent a parallel Vue runtime.
- Explicit `desiredPlacements` updates must omit Core `previous` so ADR-0010 stability cannot suppress new author intent (Auto-Layout on keeps `previous` as stability only).
- Nuxt is a validated compatibility environment (DND-FX.5). Do not create `@dndgem/nuxt` or a Nuxt plugin unless a later review proves it is required.
